# Optional: shared data folder for several PCs (UNC or local path).
# Rename to data-path.txt and put next to CREW-Documents.exe.
# First non-empty line (not starting with #) is used.
#
# Example — copy data folder from another computer to a network share:
# \\SERVER\share\CREW-data
#
# Or a local folder (must contain crew-data.json, documents\, assets\):
# D:\CREW-data
